<title>SWITZERLAND: Swiss National Bank leaves discount rate unchanged.</title>
<headline>Swiss National Bank leaves discount rate unchanged.</headline>
<dateline>ZURICH 1996-09-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Swiss National Bank (SNB) left its discount rate unchanged at 1.5 percent at the weekly meeting of its governing council, a spokesman said.</p>
<p>&quot;There has been no change in rates,&quot; the spokesman said in response to inquiries.</p>
<p>Markets had not been anticipating any change in policy.</p>
<p>-- Zurich Editorial +41 1 631 7340</p>
</text>
